      "created_at": "2013-03-26T00:15:24.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I would say so - it just says she has to deal herself damage - in the case of stuff like Ra's Solar Flare cards, if he's immune to the damage (via Imbued Fire and Flesh of the Sun God) he gets to keep the Flare in play. Okay so immunities are different…but I think Fanatic would just attempt to hit herself for two points, but it'd be reduced by whatever was reducing it and it'd still count. After all, if she was buffed (eg by Galvanise), she'd deal herself <span class=\"bbcode-i\">more</span> than two damage - there's nothing that says you have to deal <span class=\"bbcode-i\">exactly</span> two damage so I reckon if it gets reduced that's still okay :).</p>",
