      "created_at": "2013-03-26T00:18:43.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Exactly, if she somehow reduces the damage by a total of 2, then that would free her from taking damage. Along with if Ra played Imbued Fire and Flesh of the Sun God and used it's power to make everyone immune to fire, she would attempt to deal herself damage and fail at it!</p>",
